<view class="enterprise-page package-detail-page" wx:if="{{packageItem.id}}"><image class="package-cover" src="{{packageItem.cover}}" mode="aspectFill" /><view class="enterprise-card package-summary"><view class="prices"><strong>¥{{packageItem.salePrice}}</strong><del>原价 ¥{{packageItem.originalPrice}}</del><text>{{packageItem.salesCount}} 人已申请</text></view><view class="title">{{packageItem.title}}</view><view class="notice">本套餐仅用于提交咨询申请，实际诊疗方案和费用以到院评估为准。</view></view><view class="enterprise-card"><view class="enterprise-section-title">套餐介绍</view><view class="description">{{packageItem.description}}</view></view><view class="enterprise-card" wx:if="{{packageItem.images.length}}"><view class="enterprise-section-title">套餐详情</view><image class="detail-image" wx:for="{{packageItem.images}}" wx:key="id" src="{{item.imageUrl}}" mode="widthFix" /></view><view class="bottom-bar"><view><strong>¥{{packageItem.salePrice}}</strong><del>¥{{packageItem.originalPrice}}</del></view><button open-type="contact">客服</button><button class="apply" bindtap="apply">提交申请</button></view></view>
